822 0 obj
<<
/Title (Use a randomised controlled campaign where practical. Randomly assign eligible customers to a model-targeted treatment group and a comparable control group that receives the usual approach or no campaign, as appropriate. Compare outcomes over the same period. A useful primary measure is incremental conversion rate: treatment conversion rate minus control conversion rate. Also compare incremental revenue, gross margin after discounts, contact cost, unsubscribe rate, and complaints. This design helps distinguish genuine campaign lift from purchases that would have happened anyway.)
/Dest [17 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 786 0 R
>>
