/Title (Accuracy is reported for completeness, but it should not be the only decision metric. Precision matters when each contact, discount, sample, or promotion has a cost. Recall matters when missing a potential buyer is costly. F1-score provides a balance between precision and recall. AUC-ROC measures ranking ability across thresholds, while PR-AUC is especially useful if the positive purchase class is uncommon. Calibration is needed if teams interpret the model output as a probability.)
/Dest [13 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 885 0 R
/Next 906 0 R
>>
endobj
